    "title": "📅 Services and support following the passing of student Shemaiah Palma",
    "text": "1 days ago 📅 Services and support after the loss of student Shemaiah Palma\nVirginia Tech shared that Shemaiah Domingo Palma , a 21-year-old senior biochemistry major and Corps of Cadets member from Woodbridge, Virginia , died on Sept. 2 .\nServices for Shemaiah:\nViewing and visitation: Sept. 27–28, 5–9 p.m. Funeral service: Tuesday, Sept. 29, 3–7 p.m.\nLocation: Fairhaven Memorial Services, 27856 Center Drive, Mission Viejo, California\nA livestream link will be offered for those who cannot attend in person. On-campus celebration of life: Oct. 1 at 4:45 p.m. , Burruss Hall Auditorium at Virginia Tech. Support resources for anyone struggling include:\nCook Counseling Center: 540-231-6557 Dean of Students Office: 540-231-3787 Hokie Wellness (students): 540-231-2233; (employees): 540-231-8878 Housing Services: 540-231-6205 Residential Well-being: 540-231-1139 Women’s Center: 540-231-7806 University Ombuds Office: 540-231-3125 Graduate Ombudsperson: 540-231-9573 Health plans: Anthem 855-223-9277, Aetna 888-238-6232, Kaiser 866-517-7042, Sentara 800-899-8174 . More Info: In memoriam: Shemaiah Domingo Palma, senior majori...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
    "summary": "1 days ago 📅 Services and support after the loss of student Shemaiah Palma Virginia Tech shared that Shemaiah Domingo Palma , a 21-year-old senior biochemistry major and Corps of Cadets member from Woodbridge, Virginia , died on Sept. 2 . Location: Fairhaven Memorial Services, 27856 Center Drive, Mission Viejo, California A livestream link will be offered for those who cannot attend in person. On-campus celebration of life: Oct. 1 at 4:45 p.m. , Burruss Hall Auditorium at Virginia Tech.",
